Matthias Fripp and contributors. Licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.
https://github.com/switch-hawaii/data

The utility-solar hourly capacity factors used here were generated by this
pipeline (NSRDB hourly irradiance through NREL PVWatts/SAM, single-axis
backtracking; see tracking_pv.py). It is also the lineage behind the
Ulupono scenarios filed in Hawaiʻi PUC docket 2018-0088.

